Each party shall maintain insurance, including comprehensive or commercial general liability and products liability insurance (contractual liability included), with respect to its activities under this Agreement in such amounts and with such limits as reasonable and customary in the industry, but with limits not less than:

- each occurrence, one million dollars ($1,000,000);
- products/completed operations aggregate, five million dollars ($5,000,000);
- personal and advertising injury, one million dollars ($1,000,000); and
- general aggregate (commercial form only), five million dollars ($5,000,000).
